      "description": "Sul Ross State University Applicant Portal | Adjunct in Music-Band Director for Banda Lobos Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help HR Home Page Adjunct in Music-Band Director for Banda Lobos Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. PLEASE NOTE: All applications should contain complete job history entries, which includes job title, dates of employment, name of employer, supervisor’s name and phone number and a description of duties performed. If this information is not submitted, your application may be rejected because it is incomplete. Resumes and curriculum vitae do not take the place of this required information. Posting Details Posting Details Instructions to applicants PLEASE NOTE : All applications should contain complete job history entries, which includes job title, dates of employment, name of employer, supervisor’s name and phone number and a description of duties performed. If this information is not submitted, your application may be rejected because it is incomplete. Resumes and curriculum vitae do not take the place of this required information. Job Title Adjunct in Music-Band Director for Banda Lobos Location Alpine Department Visual and Performing Arts Job No. AJF982 Posting Date 08/06/2026 End Date Until Filled Yes Appointment Date Salary $2,700 per course Required Master’s degree and at least one conferred degree in Music with woodwind, brass, guitar, or percussion as a major applied instrument area. Preferred Terminal degree in music or equivalent. A record of successful music education (K-12) teaching and professional performance experience. Interest and willingness to recruit and grow the program (and position). Primary Responsibilities Primary Responsibilities : The Sul Ross State University Music Program of the Department of Visual and Performing Arts seeks an Adjunct in Music to serve as a part-time m